title A probe run cut off by a crash: defaults go back once the machine can take MDI
needs probe-basic
xfail mymill: millgui restores at power-on before homing; the MDI is refused ("not homed"), the restore is dropped and HOME ALL then stalls
# What probe.rs leaves behind when millgui dies mid-run (Settings "probe").
seed .local/state/millgui/probe probe.restore-pending=1
include ../common/ready.scn
idle 30
shot after-restore
